Package: dungx.wifibruter
Name: WiFiBruter
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
Version: 1.0-1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Section: Tweaks
Maintainer: Kilo
Description: Automatically attempts WiFi passcodes from a wordlist on jailbroken iOS. Configurable from the Settings app. Primarily targets iOS 12 and iOS 15. For authorized security testing only.
